---

 Initial Data Assessment

Both datasets were successfully opened and inspected in QGIS.

The sediment dataset contains the nine sampling locations and measurements of Th, U, Nb, Rb, Ba and Zr at each location. No missing coordinate or concentration values were identified.

The OpenStreetMap dataset contains 774 mapped waterway features within the queried study area. It provides the surrounding river, stream and canal network needed to place the sediment sampling locations within their wider geographic context.

Both datasets use EPSG:4326 — WGS 84 and can therefore be displayed together in QGIS. The main data-quality issue identified is the presence of NULL values in several optional OpenStreetMap attributes. This does not affect the use of the waterway geometries for the current project.
